      "argumentative_moves": [
        "Resurrects Otto Neurath's interwar critique to bypass the Mises/Hayek/Lange stalemate in the Socialist Calculation Debate.",
        "Uses the 'vintage problem' (technological heterogeneity) to prove there is no single 'optimal' recipe for production.",
        "Distinguishes between 'technical reasoning' (viability) and 'democratic selection' (desirability)."
      ],
